{
    "title": "POIZON - Sneakers & Apparel",
    "description": "POIZON is the curated fashion marketplace for exploring, pursuing, and sharing authenticated premium goods. Here, you can find authenticated sneakers, shoes, apparel, accessories, bags, watches, and more from across the world. Our essence is rooted in bridging the pillars of quality, authenticity, affordability, fast delivery, and unparalleled customer service.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS:\r\nPOIZON integrates buying and selling functionalities, delivering an excellent experience for both buyers and sellers. Our shopping process follows the principle of \"authenticate first, ship later.\" Our multi-step authentication process makes online shopping a more reassuring experience.\r\n\r\nWHAT IT PROVIDES:\r\n(A) Wide Selection: Discover favorites among POIZON's wide range of goods, including sneakers, shoes, apparel, bags, and more from leading brands like Nike, Gucci, Jordan, Adidas, Burberry, and New Balance. Enjoy a global shopping experience with the latest trends and timeless classics.\r\n\r\n(B) Quality & Authenticity: With authentication powered by AI and experts, POIZON ensures genuine transactions for over 300+ million goods, safeguarding product quality and authenticity at every step. POIZON also provides a FREE AI-driven authentication tool for both buyers and sellers to experience.\r\n\r\n(C) Hassle-Free Returns & Customer Service: Enjoy the convenience of an enhanced return policy and 24/7 customer service.\r\n\r\n(D) For Empowering Sellers: (1) Sell faster - 60% of products are purchased within just one day. (2) Earn more - POIZON\u2019s effective tools allow for sales at the right time and the best price.\r\n\r\nITEMS YOU CAN BUY OR SELL:\r\nSneakers & Shoes: A wide selection featuring popular brands like Jordan, Nike, Adidas, New Balance, and many others.\r\n\r\nApparel: Supreme, Fear of God, The North Face, and more, offering a range of items including coats, jackets, hoodies, sweatshirts, and pants.\r\n\r\nBags: Louis Vuitton, Balenciaga, and Gucci, with a diverse range of styles including shoulder bags, backpacks, clutch bags, wallets, and pouches.\r\n\r\nAccessories: Hermes, Chanel, Casio, and others, offering a variety of items such as belts, eyewear, watches, scarves, gloves, hats, and more.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\nURL: www.poizon.com\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/poizonapp\r\nInstagram: www.instagram.com/poizonapp\r\nTik Tok: www.tiktok.com/@poizon_app\r\nEmail: support@poizon.com",
